# Browser
# Gwenom, Remorseless attacks on turn three into Bot2's Colossal Dreadmaw, which blocks. Deathtouch kills the Dreadmaw,
# lifelink gains Bot1 4 life, and the Dreadmaw's 6 damage kills Gwenom. The attack trigger had already resolved, so its
# effect lasts the turn without Gwenom (CR 611.2a): in the second main phase Bot1 may still look at the top card of its
# library and casts the Lightning Bolt there for 1 life. Bot1 then plays a Swamp from its hand, and the Tundra now on top
# can't be played: the effect gives no extra land play (CR 305.2). Bot1's page says both play rules beside its life total
# though Gwenom is gone, the effect being the player's; Bot2's page shows none, and nothing is left on turn four.

